    "sub_ename": "MICROPROCESSOR SYSTEMS",
    "describe_ch": "本課程介紹微處理機系統結構, 記憶體元件, 記憶體介面, I/O設備, I/O介面, 以及I/O方法之Polling I/O, Interrupt I/O, DMA I/O。",
    "describe_eh": "This course introduces to students the basic ideas and knowledge of microprocessor system architecture, memory chip, memory interface, I/O device, I/O interface, and Polling I/O, Interrupt I/O, DMA I/O.",
    "pre_subname": "IEE1006邏輯設計、IECS2053數位系統設計、IECS1008程式設計(III)、IEE1003計算機概論實習(二)",
